/-! fable-famapp seal: the family row's shadow at the class-B fixture `RI`, in the landed twin
`gEnv` and in the consistent twin `cEnv`; the way back (`RcicFamAppLiftBack`): `riEnv`'s
family row from its Π row, `TypedRowsWf riEnv n ↔ PiRowField riEnv n`; sort/Π disjointness
over every scoped environment, hence at `riEnv` (`RcicFamAppSortPiDisj`), the second route; and
THE Π ROW ITSELF (`RcicFamAppCopyTwin` + `RcicFamAppPiRow`): the copy-only twin `gEnv₀` (empty
inductive group + axiom `mk₀`, rows from the landed supplier), its metatheory from the
predicate-level cores (`TwinMeta`), the renaming back, `riPiRow : PiRowField riEnv n` and
`riTypedRowsWf : TypedRowsWf riEnv n` for every `n`, by both landed reductions.
THE GENERIC VERSION (`RcicFamAppRevTr`/`RevShape`/`RevEnv`/`RevBack`/`RevPiRow`): for EVERY revealed singleton
(`RevEnv`: an in-scope base, a closed level-free index type `I`, `F : Π (i : I), Sort 0`, `mk : Π (x : I), F x`,
the AnySort recursor), the copy-only twin with the axiom at the constructor's reference, the translation
`rec.{l} ↦ recTG l` (base ι witnesses transported, the singleton's ι read in the twin), the identity way
back, the K-like cell, and `RevEnv.revPiRow : PiRowField R.E n`, `RevEnv.revSortRow`; THE FAMILY ROW
(`RcicFamAppRevFamRow`): read in the twin, brought back slot by slot, assembled by the landed §7.4 reduction
(`famAppRow_of_piRow_saturation_slotConv`) — `RevEnv.revFamAppRow`, hence `RevEnv.revTypedRowsWf :
TypedRowsWf R.E n` for every revealed singleton, and the fixture's second basis `riTypedRowsWf_generic`;
GAP β / BOUNDED TRANSPORT & GENERIC BOUNDED INTERNAL INJECTIVITY (`RcicFamAppRevLok`): `LOKt`/`LOKc`/`LOKtc`
preservation across `bkTyB`/`bkConvB`/`bkTyConvB` (`Iff`, zero overhead), `lok_trConv_selfB` across the
K-like cell and round trip, generic `RevEnv.rev_inj_internalB` and `RevEnv.rev_inj_internalB_lok` for EVERY
revealed singleton (including `Foo : Nat → Prop`), and structural ι-witness separation `NoRecIota` / `DiagRecIota`
(`noRecIota_bkConvB`, `diagRecIota_trConv_selfB`, `twinIdxConvB_lok_and_diag`).
Axioms ⊆ {propext, Quot.sound}. closure_claim = 0. -/

